  Snippet: button
  Renders the shared ZINARA button component (primary/secondary/ghost).
  Full implementation lands in Phase 2 (design system).

  Accepts:
  - label: {String} button text (required)
  - url: {String} href (optional — renders <button> when omitted)
  - style: {String} "primary" | "secondary" | "ghost" (optional)
{% endcomment %}
